# Markdown: everything is ignored except the README.
#
# The "!docs/**" exception was deliberately removed on 2026-09-30, so that the
# editor greys out the files in docs/ as it usually does.
#
# Consequence, verified with "git check-ignore -v": the whole docs/ folder is
# ignored. This is the exact configuration that kept docs/ out of the backend
# repository, where it was an unnoticed bug. Here it is a deliberate choice,
# but the outcome is identical if it is forgotten.
#
# UNCOMMENT THE LINE BELOW BEFORE COMMITTING docs/. Checked at FRONT-24.
*.md
!README.md
# !docs/**

# Precaution: any local backup of this file stays out of the repository.
.gitignore.backup
